<title>CHINA: Yau Lee yearly net rises 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Yau Lee yearly net rises 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	    3.9	 vs 2.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)     1.0	 vs 0.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	   6.73 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			     30.40     vs 22.36</p>
<p>    Turnover			1,614.59  vs 1,571.63</p>
<p>    Company name		  Yau lee Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		   Aug 29 - Sept 4</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	    Sept 26</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is a building contractor. Exceptional items represent loss from sale of a long term investment and write down of an investment in an associated company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
